    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows, USD rate. Cost of equity = 4.3% 10y UST + 0.95 beta x 4.75% ERP = ~8.8%; after-tax cost of debt ~4.0% x (1-0.24) = 3.0%; market weights ~82% equity / 18% debt (mkt cap ~$87B, debt $18.9B) -> WACC ~7.8%, rounded to 8.0%. Same WACC in all scenarios: cyclicality, coal exposure and the UP-NS competitive threat are charged in the bear/bull flows and weights, not in the discount rate.",
